  {
    "insert": "\nThe motivation should explain to the reader why the chosen topic is relevant and which weakness the thesis wants to address. The problem is well presented in your motivation, but could be explained more clearly. Read through your text again and add more details to the problems. In particular, think about what the consequences of the problem are. "
