  },
  {
    "insert": "Within the theoretical framework, the theories used in the work are presented and their relevance justified. Your theoretical framework is very good, but could be a little more detailed.  In particular, the relevance of Gagne's nine teaching events could be explained in more detail. In addition, SOTA could make it clearer where the current weaknesses lie. "
