  },
  {
    "insert": "In scientific work it is very important to have a standardised terminology. Abbreviations must always be introduced at the beginning and then used consistently (e.g. ‘AI’, ‘LLM’). Unfortunately, you have not achieved this in your text. This problem interrupts the reading flow and could confuse the reader. Go through your text again carefully and adjust the abbreviations."
